{"ghsa_id":"GHSA-59q6-j4w8-8pjx","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OISF/suricata/security-advisories/GHSA-59q6-j4w8-8pjx","html_url":"https://github.com/OISF/suricata/security/advisories/GHSA-59q6-j4w8-8pjx","summary":"detect/transform: use-after-free in dotprefix transform","description":"### Impact\r\n\r\nSuricata's inspection-buffer helper could leave an inspection pointer referencing freed memory after a chained transform caused the backing buffer to be reallocated.\r\n\r\nThe issue is reached during a specific network traffic processing, and requires a specific but not malicious rule.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nUpgrade to Suricata 8.0.5 or 7.0.16.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nAvoid rules that chain `dotprefix` transform after another one.\r\n\r\n### References\r\n\r\nhttps://redmine.openinfosecfoundation.org/issues/8537\r\n\r\n### Credits\r\n\r\nTrail of Bits, in collaboration with Anthropic.\r\n","severity":"medium","author":null,"publisher":{"login":"jasonish","id":644115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDExNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/644115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"identifiers":[{"value":"GHSA-59q6-j4w8-8pjx","type":"GHSA"},{"value":"CVE-2026-45751","type":"CVE"}],"state":"published","created_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-06-02T20:38:08Z","published_at":"2026-06-02T20:38:08Z","closed_at":null,"withdrawn_at":null,"submission":null,"vulnerabilities":[{"package":{"ecosystem":"other","name":"suricata"},"vulnerable_version_range":"< 7.0.16, < 8.0.5","patched_versions":"7.0.16, 8.0.5","vulnerable_functions":[]}],"cvss_severities":{"cvss_v3":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":5.9},"cvss_v4":{"vector_string":null,"score":null}},"cwes":[{"cwe_id":"CWE-416","name":"Use After Free"}],"cwe_ids":["CWE-416"],"credits":[],"credits_detailed":[],"collaborating_users":null,"collaborating_teams":null,"private_fork":null,"comments":1,"cvss":{"vector_string":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H","score":5.9}}